menuconfig DRIVERS_UBX_HPE
	bool "u-blox HPE raw recorder"
	default n
	---help---
		Raw UART recorder for u-blox HPE receivers such as ZED-X20P and ZED-F9P.
		The first implementation records receiver bytes to a .ubx file and/or the
		existing gps_dump uORB topic. Receiver configuration and UBX message parsing
		can be layered in later without competing with the generic GPS driver.
